RI=rule('pesticide-import','Resolve pesticide import responsibility before shipping','products-supply','Federal','Importing FIFRA-regulated pesticide or device','Importer / importing agent','Actual product is within FIFRA scope; classification and exceptions require product review.','Confirm lawful product and establishment status, label and Notice of Arrival process for the actual shipment.','Before shipment/arrival','NOA before arrival per EPA guidance; filing details depend on entry route',['Product composition and claims','EPA status evidence','Importer allocation','Broker instructions'],[IMP],['No current tariff quote or product registration conclusion provided.'])
